Purpose:
Module-related API endpoints ko corresponding controller functions ke saath connect karta hai.

Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Purpose
POST	/api/modules	Naya module create karta hai
GET	/api/modules	Saare modules fetch karta hai
GET	/api/modules/:moduleId/lessons	Specific module ke lessons fetch karta hai

Last endpoint getLessonsByModule() controller ko call karta hai.